  "headline": "President Prabowo To Submit Vice Presidential Nominees By Late November",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo To Submit Vice Presidential Nominees",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto is expected to submit two vice presidential candidates for consideration by November 25 following discussions on potential names.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto is scheduled to submit two potential vice presidential nominees to the legislature by November 25.",
    "Internal discussions within the Gerindra party have highlighted several potential candidates, including Ahmad Muzani, Sufmi Dasco Ahmad, and Sugiono.",
    "Party officials have emphasized that the final selection remains at the discretion of the President, who is currently concluding travel abroad."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The political discourse in Indonesia is currently centered on the selection of a new vice presidential candidate to succeed Gibran Rakabuming Raka. Following reports of impending submissions, figures such as Yusril Ihza Mahendra confirmed that the President is expected to present two candidates for the position no later than November 25. While external observers and some DPD members have suggested various public figures and regional leaders, including Sri Sultan Hamengkubuwono X, focus has largely remained on internal party dynamics. Gerindra spokespeople have noted that the party has its own considerations, emphasizing that any chosen candidate must demonstrate loyalty to the President. As discussions continue, leadership remains in a holding pattern while waiting for the President to return from official international engagements to finalize the decision-making process regarding the upcoming appointment.",
